        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field of Screams</strong> is a first-person bodycam horror game where every decision could mean the difference between saving a life or taking one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/ed428b321658a5a9b43755400d409a37.poster.avif?t=1760365677\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/ed428b321658a5a9b43755400d409a37.webm?t=1760365677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/ed428b321658a5a9b43755400d409a37.mp4?t=1760365677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a police officer responding to a late-night assault call at <i>Field of Screams</i>, a haunted cornfield attraction that hides something far darker than Halloween scares. What begins as a standard dispatch quickly unravels into a nightmare of shadows, screams, and split-second decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your service weapon, you must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate the Maze</strong> – Wind your way through twisting cornfields and dark paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Identify Threats</strong> – Spot the killers lurking among the stalks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Split-Second Choices</strong> – Pull the trigger too late, and you may not make it out alive. Pull it too soon, and innocent blood will be on your hands.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Answer the Maze’s Questions</strong> – Discover clues throughout the maze to help identify your way through.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/d607c26b734ba5475fd2e584141e3b82.poster.avif?t=1760365677\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/d607c26b734ba5475fd2e584141e3b82.webm?t=1760365677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/d607c26b734ba5475fd2e584141e3b82.mp4?t=1760365677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>bodycam perspective</strong>, jumpscares, and tense sound design, <i>Field of Screams</i> blurs the line between survival horror and psychological thriller. Every corner of the maze forces you to question who is innocent and who the killers are</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/65ee510b196a9b46f755fe6631d579fd.poster.avif?t=1760365677\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/65ee510b196a9b46f755fe6631d579fd.webm?t=1760365677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/65ee510b196a9b46f755fe6631d579fd.mp4?t=1760365677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Note that this is the first game of many more to come from a solo developer.*</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field of Screams</strong> is a first-person bodycam horror game where every decision could mean the difference between saving a life or taking one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/ed428b321658a5a9b43755400d409a37.poster.avif?t=1760365677\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/ed428b321658a5a9b43755400d409a37.webm?t=1760365677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/ed428b321658a5a9b43755400d409a37.mp4?t=1760365677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a police officer responding to a late-night assault call at <i>Field of Screams</i>, a haunted cornfield attraction that hides something far darker than Halloween scares. What begins as a standard dispatch quickly unravels into a nightmare of shadows, screams, and split-second decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your service weapon, you must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate the Maze</strong> – Wind your way through twisting cornfields and dark paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Identify Threats</strong> – Spot the killers lurking among the stalks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Split-Second Choices</strong> – Pull the trigger too late, and you may not make it out alive. Pull it too soon, and innocent blood will be on your hands.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Answer the Maze’s Questions</strong> – Discover clues throughout the maze to help identify your way through.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/d607c26b734ba5475fd2e584141e3b82.poster.avif?t=1760365677\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/d607c26b734ba5475fd2e584141e3b82.webm?t=1760365677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/d607c26b734ba5475fd2e584141e3b82.mp4?t=1760365677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>bodycam perspective</strong>, jumpscares, and tense sound design, <i>Field of Screams</i> blurs the line between survival horror and psychological thriller. Every corner of the maze forces you to question who is innocent and who the killers are</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/65ee510b196a9b46f755fe6631d579fd.poster.avif?t=1760365677\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/65ee510b196a9b46f755fe6631d579fd.webm?t=1760365677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035460/extras/65ee510b196a9b46f755fe6631d579fd.mp4?t=1760365677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Note that this is the first game of many more to come from a solo developer.*</p>",
